        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<br><br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong dir=\"auto\">Borkowska, Magda</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href=\"mailto:m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk\">m.borkowska@essex.ac.uk</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Tue, Sep 10, 2024 at 2:02 PM<br>Subject: Avicenna's current app testing<br>To: <a href=\"mailto:Paul.Mccrorie@glasgow.ac.uk\">Paul.Mccrorie@glasgow.ac.uk</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Paul.McCrorie@glasgow.ac.uk\">Paul.McCrorie@glasgow.ac.uk</a>&gt;, <a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a> &lt;<a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt;<br>\n</div>\n<br><br><div><div lang=\"EN-GB\">\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">Hi Paul, hi Fi</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">Hope you’re well. As promised here are the instructions of how to create participant and researcher account for the current Avicenna app. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">If you have troubles with setting app your accounts please contact <a href=\"mailto:sara@avicennaresearch.com\">sara@avicennaresearch.com</a> and CC me. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">Once you’ve created your researcher account please let me know and I’ll add you to the platform. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">All best</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">Magda</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">*****************************************************************************</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#222222;\">To test your sample study from the participant's perspective, please follow the instructions below:</span></p>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n<li> Install the Avicenna mobile application on your smartphone. You can find the iOS app <a href=\"https://1c68cfb9.streaklinks.com/CHYbjf_vL4uQNG-p0gdnlmit/https%3A%2F%2Flinkprotect.cudasvc.com%2Furl%3Fa%3Dhttps%253a%252f%252fappsto.re%252fi6h78DQ%26c%3DE%2C1%2CrHOzsqpqozYdulAOWhP3YS2nDGPrQCZIyKctAsXcWe0jyuqteby3cATAL4BnRXLGESmpKzcSp8F5wtbwynxPULvmyPWlG7lWjnuATwQxFaEuocNkmw%2C%2C%26typo%3D1\" title=\"https://appsto.re/i6h78DQ\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">here</span></a> and the Android app <a href=\"https://1c68cfb9.streaklinks.com/CHYbjgA-vu3cWAU81w1RY7fr/https%3A%2F%2Fplay.google.com%2Fstore%2Fapps%2Fdetails%3Fid%3Dcom.ethica.logger\" title=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ethica.logger\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">here</span></a>. </li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\n<li> Launch the app and sign up as a new participant. Please note that you need to use the provided email address(es) as your username but you can choose your own password. </li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"3\" type=\"1\">\n<li> When you are asked to enter the study registration code, enter the provided Study ID and follow the instructions. Check <a href=\"https://1c68cfb9.streaklinks.com/CHYbjgAbm09y-BnU-wjpGMeG/https%3A%2F%2Flinkprotect.cudasvc.com%2Furl%3Fa%3Dhttps%253a%252f%252flearn.avicennaresearch.com%252freference%252fstudy-setup-and-deployment%252fenrollment%252f%26c%3DE%2C1%2CyzcZlxjKzcb3MBkbbxC1vtwK64OOyt9BvLzuLIuCWbZqjrDhJ7G-Ndx1REKHmarfu5cPkpELLN-IZfXz_FJtMo7SBhwll9gMQPQfSZNukp6JlJ8YvSeNyI50QQ%2C%2C%26typo%3D1\" title=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/reference/study-setup-and-deployment/enrollment/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">this document</span></a> to learn more about this registration process. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">- Study ID: <b>3950</b></span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">- Participants’ usernames:</span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant1@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant1@essex.ac.uk</span></a> <span lang=\"PL\">Magda</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant2@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant2@essex.ac.uk</span></a> <span lang=\"PL\">Giulia</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<b><a href=\"mailto:participant3@essex.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant3@essex.ac.uk</span></a> Paul Mc</b>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant4@essex.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant4@essex.ac.uk</span></a> Annette </li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant5@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant5@essex.ac.uk</span></a> <span lang=\"PL\">Jon</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant6@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant6@essex.ac.uk</span></a> <span lang=\"PL\">Jim</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant7@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant7@essex.ac.uk</span></a> <span lang=\"PL\">Sam</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant8@essex.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant8@essex.ac.uk</span></a> Owen </li>\n<li>\n<b><a href=\"mailto:participant9@essex.ac.uk\"><span lang=\"PL\" style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant9@essex.ac.uk</span></a></b><b>\n<span lang=\"PL\">Fi C</span></b>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"mailto:participant10@essex.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">participant10@essex.ac.uk</span></a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">Moreover, if you and your team members would like to also try the researcher's side of our platform, you can create a researcher account <a href=\"https://1c68cfb9.streaklinks.com/CHYbjgEl5cegMU0fkAx-jp_s/https%3A%2F%2Flinkprotect.cudasvc.com%2Furl%3Fa%3Dhttps%253a%252f%252favicennaresearch.com%252fapp%252fdashboard%252fauth%252fsign-up%252fresearcher%26c%3DE%2C1%2Cz6M8weYS3BadxCda0gao1zWzMMoeGV8HQW3IZcK9xuDL6ae6-Gpv73_zRsVwuF2BDjfYFt3ZtNSzJ2F7VNYl7wdHcIqZ0asxVm-BJ7Kdb9oCjOyzGGLS%26typo%3D1\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/dashboard/auth/sign-up/researcher\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">here</span></a> using the email addresses you shared with me earlier. Once done, please let me know so that I can add you as researchers to Study ID: <b>3950</b>. As researchers, you will be able to access the sample study in your researcher dashboard.</span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">Alternatively, if you prefer to join the study as participants using your organizational email addresses, please inform me so that I can invite the email addresses you shared before as participants.</span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\"> </span></p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;\">If you have any questions in the meantime, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div>ᐧ</div>",
